---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import '../styles/global.css';
import {
	business,
	directionsUrl,
	emailHref,
	facebookUrl,
	galleryPhotos,
	instagramUrl,
	mapEmbedUrl,
	mapsUrl,
	ogImage,
	phoneHrefs,
	services,
	structuredData,
} from '../lib/business';

const title = 'Gym Krono | Gimnasio en Teatinos, Málaga';
const description =
	'Gym Krono, gimnasio de barrio en Calle Juan Margarit, 4 (Teatinos), Málaga. Sala de musculación, cardio y monitores. Llama al 952 27 20 19 o consulta cómo llegar.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta name="theme-color" content="#131516" />
		<meta name="description" content={description} />
		<meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-image-preview:large" />
		<meta name="geo.region" content="ES-MA" />
		<meta name="geo.placename" content="Málaga" />
		<meta name="geo.position" content={`${business.latitude};${business.longitude}`} />
		<meta name="ICBM" content={`${business.latitude}, ${business.longitude}`} />
		<link rel="canonical" href={`${business.site}/`} />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/gym-krono/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
		<link
			href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap"
			rel="stylesheet"
		/>
		<title>{title}</title>
		<meta property="og:type" content="business.business" />
		<meta property="og:locale" content="es_ES" />
		<meta property="og:site_name" content={business.name} />
		<meta property="og:title" content={title} />
		<meta property="og:description" content={description} />
		<meta property="og:url" content={`${business.site}/`} />
		<meta property="og:image" content={ogImage} />
		<meta property="og:image:alt" content="GYM KRONO, gimnasio en Teatinos, Málaga" />
		<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
		<meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
		<meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />
		<meta name="twitter:image" content={ogImage} />
		<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(structuredData)} />
		<link rel="sitemap" type="application/xml" href="/sitemap-index.xml" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<a class="skip-link" href="#contenido">Saltar al contenido</a>
		<header class="site-header">
			<a class="brand" href="#inicio" aria-label="Gym Krono, inicio"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">K</span><span class="brand-label">GYM KRONO <small>GIMNASIO · TEATINOS</small></span></a>
			<nav aria-label="Navegación principal"><a href="#servicios">Servicios</a><a href="#contacto">Contacto</a></nav>
			<a class="header-phone" href={phoneHrefs[0]}><span aria-hidden="true">☎</span> {business.phones[0]}</a>
		</header>

		<main id="contenido">
			<section class="hero" id="inicio" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
				<div class="hero-content">
					<p class="eyebrow"><span></span> MUSCULACIÓN · CARDIO · MONITORES</p>
					<h1 id="hero-title">Entrena a<br /><em>tu manera.</em></h1>
					<p class="hero-intro">Gym Krono es el gimnasio de barrio de Teatinos, Málaga: una sala amplia, todo tipo de máquinas y monitores que te corrigen y te acompañan. Sin complicaciones y con trato cercano.</p>
					<div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-amber" href={phoneHrefs[0]}><span aria-hidden="true">☎</span> Llamar al gimnasio</a><a class="button button-ghost" href={directionsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Cómo llegar <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
					<div class="hero-location"><span class="location-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><p>{business.district}<br /><strong>{business.city} · Andalucía</strong></p></div>
				</div>
				<figure class="hero-figure">
					<div class="figure-label"><span>KRONO / 01</span><span>SALA DE ENTRENAMIENTO · MÁLAGA</span></div>
					<svg class="hero-plate" viewBox="0 0 460 300" role="img" aria-label="Ilustración de una mancuerna, símbolo del gimnasio">
						<use href="#krono-mark" />
					</svg>
					<figcaption><span>COMPARTE LA FICHA DE GOOGLE MAPS</span><a href={mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Ver ficha ↗</a></figcaption>
				</figure>
			</section>

			<section class="salon-strip" id="servicios" aria-label="Instalaciones y servicios de Gym Krono">
				<p class="strip-title"><span>01 /</span> QUÉ ENCONTRARÁS</p>
				<div><span>01</span><strong>Musculación</strong></div>
				<div><span>02</span><strong>Cardio</strong></div>
				<div><span>03</span><strong>Monitores</strong></div>
			</section>

			<section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
				<p class="section-label"><span>02 /</span> GYM KRONO · TEATINOS</p>
				<div class="about-content"><h2 id="about-title">Un gimnasio<br /><em>de los de siempre.</em></h2><div><p>En Krono entrenas a gusto: instalaciones cuidadas, una gran variedad de máquinas para cada grupo muscular y monitores atentos que te explican y corrigen la técnica. Un ambiente familiar, sin masificaciones y con todo lo necesario para progresar.</p><a class="social-link" href={instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Síguenos en Instagram <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
				<div class="service-list">{services.map((service) => <article class="service-card"><h3>{service.name}</h3><p>{service.detail}</p></article>)}</div>
				<div class="about-footer"><span>GIMNASIO TEATINOS</span><span>MÁLAGA</span><span>✳</span></div>
			</section>

			<section class="gallery-section" id="galeria" aria-labelledby="gallery-title">
				<p class="section-label"><span>03 /</span> GALERÍA</p>
				<div class="gallery-content"><h2 id="gallery-title">El gimnasio<br /><em>por dentro.</em></h2><p>Algunas imágenes de Gym Krono. Toca cualquiera para ver la galería completa en Google Maps.</p></div>
				<div class="gallery-grid">{galleryPhotos.map((photo, index) => <a class="gallery-photo" href={mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label={`Ver la foto ${index + 1} de Gym Krono en Google Maps`}><Image src={photo.src} alt={photo.alt} widths={[320, 480, 640]} sizes="(max-width: 700px) 92vw, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 30vw" format="webp" quality={65} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a>)}</div>
				<div class="gallery-footer"><span>IMÁGENES DE LA FICHA DE GOOGLE MAPS</span><a href={mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Ver todas ↗</a></div>
			</section>

			<section class="contact-section" id="contacto" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
				<p class="section-label"><span>04 /</span> VISÍTANOS</p>
				<div class="contact-layout">
					<div class="contact-copy"><p class="contact-kicker">ESTAMOS EN TEATINOS</p><h2 id="contact-title">Empieza<br /><em>hoy.</em></h2>
						<div class="contact-card">
							<div class="contact-row"><span aria-hidden="true">⌖</span><div><small>DIRECCIÓN</small><address>{business.streetAddress}<br />{business.postalCode} {business.city}</address></div></div>
							<div class="contact-row"><span aria-hidden="true">☎</span><div><small>LLÁMANOS</small><a href={phoneHrefs[0]}>{business.phones[0]}</a></div></div>
							<div class="contact-row"><span aria-hidden="true">✉</span><div><small>ESCRÍBENOS</small><a href={emailHref}>{business.email}</a></div></div>
						</div>
						<a class="button button-dark" href={directionsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Abrir indicaciones <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
					</div>
					<div class="map-card"><div class="map-header"><span><i></i> JUAN MARGARIT · MÁLAGA</span><a href={mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">ABRIR MAPS ↗</a></div><div style="position:relative;width:100%;min-height:300px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:inherit;">
<iframe title="Mapa de Gym Krono en Calle Juan Margarit, Málaga" src={mapEmbedUrl} loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" allowfullscreen></iframe>
						<noscript>
							<p style="margin:0;padding:1rem;text-align:center;"><a href={directionsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cómo llegar en Google Maps ↗</a></p>
						</noscript>
					</div><div class="map-footer"><span aria-hidden="true">⌖</span><div><strong>{business.name}</strong><small>{business.streetAddress} · {business.city}</small></div><a href={directionsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="Cómo llegar a Gym Krono">↗</a></div></div>
				</div>
				<div class="social-row"><span>ENCUÉNTRANOS TAMBIÉN EN</span><a href={instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a><a href={facebookUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Facebook ↗</a></div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<footer class="site-footer"><a class="brand footer-brand" href="#inicio" aria-label="Gym Krono, volver al inicio"><span class="brand-mark">K</span><span class="brand-label">GYM KRONO <small>GIMNASIO · TEATINOS</small></span></a><p>{business.streetAddress}, {business.city}<br /><a href={phoneHrefs[0]}>{business.phones[0]}</a></p><a class="footer-social" href={instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Gym Krono · Málaga</small>
			<p style="font-size: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.7; margin: 0.5rem 0 0;">
				<small>Web creada por <a href="https://sur-digital.vercel.app/" rel="noopener">Sur Digital</a></small>
			</p>
		<nav class="sur-legal" aria-label="Información legal y créditos" style="box-sizing:border-box;flex:0 0 100%;width:100%;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.35rem 1.1rem;margin:1.2rem 0 0;padding:0 1.25rem;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.7;text-align:center;opacity:.85">
			<a href="/gym-krono/aviso-legal" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px">Aviso legal</a>
			<a href="/gym-krono/aviso-legal#privacidad" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px">Privacidad</a>
			<a href="/gym-krono/aviso-legal#cookies" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px">Cookies</a>
		</nav>
		</footer>
		<a class="phone-cta" href={phoneHrefs[0]}><span aria-hidden="true">☎</span> Llamar a Gym Krono <strong>{business.phones[0]}</strong></a>

		<svg width="0" height="0" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="position:absolute">
			<defs>
				<linearGradient id="krono-plate" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
					<stop stop-color="#ffcc33" />
					<stop offset="1" stop-color="#e09b00" />
				</linearGradient>
				<g id="krono-mark">
					<rect x="120" y="138" width="220" height="24" rx="12" fill="#8f8f8f" />
					<rect x="92" y="78" width="34" height="144" rx="12" fill="url(#krono-plate)" />
					<rect x="62" y="98" width="30" height="104" rx="10" fill="url(#krono-plate)" />
					<rect x="334" y="78" width="34" height="144" rx="12" fill="url(#krono-plate)" />
					<rect x="368" y="98" width="30" height="104" rx="10" fill="url(#krono-plate)" />
				</g>
			</defs>
		</svg>
	</body>
</html>


